Cell["\<\
Finally, let us calculate the inverse of the versor as a product of inverse \
vectors in reversed order without using the matrices at all \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.685166374808083*^9, 3.685166427915975*^9}, {
   3.685166485052012*^9, 3.685166542294676*^9}, {3.685171457968946*^9, 
